WEBVTT

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:07.633
Your images. A clearer path to export.. Meet Thoock. One desktop workspace for your stock-image workflow.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:13.633
Bring your existing images.. Import a batch into the review queue. Keep the work together.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:20.633
Research. Brief. Create.. Turn an opportunity into a structured brief, then generate with your own AI provider.

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:27.633
Review first. Make it count.. Inspect your candidates. Complete human checks and image metadata.

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:34.633
Images + metadata. Ready to take with you.. Prepare approved images and Adobe-compatible CSV files for manual submission.

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:41.633
Make room for the work.. Try the free beta. No Thoock account required.
